cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite both this repository and the upstream paper/repository it is derived from."
title: "SweatUric-AI：汗液尿酸无创监测的因果机器学习分析管线（尿酸场景移植版）"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SweatUric-AI team"        # 材料初评为盲审，成员姓名与单位不在仓库内披露
date-released: 2026-09-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hu305/sweaturic-causal-ml"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Causal-assumption-guided machine-learning pipeline that transfers the
  DAG-first modelling paradigm of the PolyCORE lipid study to non-invasive
  sweat uric-acid monitoring. Ships only with synthetic, schema-compatible
  demo data; the reported metrics validate the code, not any device or
  clinical performance.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - directed acyclic graph
  - sweat uric acid
  - GroupKFold
  - synthetic data
references:
  - type: article                    # 上游论文：本仓库四个核心脚本的改编来源
    title: "Non-invasive continuous lipid profiling via cofactor-refreshing cascading enzymatic reactions and causal machine learning"
